[{"title":"和雪三十韵","author":"韦骧","text":"密雪连空散，同云盖野繁。\n朝晖掩羲驭，暮象蔽天垠。\n皦皦漫长陌，霏霏集短垣。\n杉松苍翠夺，禽鸟语声吞。\n病足樵斤敛，寻踪猎骑奔。\n金茎迷沆瀣，银界变昆崙。\n光借寒儒牖，威消贵胄门。\n酤帘表深巷，爨屋露幽村。\n可响红炉烬，难忘醁酒樽。\n竹梢低欲折，梅萼重犹存。\n没谷吟当楚，离江咏去袁。\n高才题不尽，妙曲写仍翻。\n旅雁宵飞戢，栖鸡晓舌扪。\n塞严添玉垒，林迥化琼园。\n远岸舟藏鹢，高楼瓦匿鸳。\n秋涛千浪叠，夜甲万军屯。\n缀若凝酥洁，堆如琢琥蹲。\n脂车休旅传，锵佩放天阍。\n不以多为瑞，谁言即也温。\n神锋剪何利，地轴卷无痕。\n暗与春工敌，清随朔吹喷。\n朽株银作叶，圆沼璧为盆。\n照耀偏宜月，侵陵只有萱。\n藩篱白羽插，略彴素虬蜿。\n汀鹭难求侣，城乌不辨昏。\n流年垂改籥，危坐祗销魂。\n自视丰和兆，心穷造化元。\n纷纷沾动植，渺渺助乾坤。\n屏盭殊强力，滋枯独养原。\n芸然知矣否，雨露未成恩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46324,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又和倒韵","author":"韦骧","text":"匿疵真有德，值物不偏恩。\n细或穿幽隙，悠然被广原。\n皑皑均旦暮，浩浩壹乾坤。\n凛冽添寒气，苍茫返混元。\n鹄鸥潜失影，狐貉暗忘魂。\n竹重风旌袅，池凝晓鉴昏。\n飞毫玉兔脱，蟠径素龙蜿。\n陵弱侵庭柳，埋青抑砌萱。\n屑琼谁措手，鍊粉若为盆。\n当迥墙头积，回飙瓦口喷。\n群飞停啅噪，万丑掩瘢痕。\n穷巷情方惮，豪堂势自温。\n萧条孤驿路，冷落古祠阍。\n乱辙分明印，双鸱彷佛蹲。\n何时飘絮定，著处白云屯。\n酒榼倾浮蚁，吟笺染戏鸳。\n妙才窥赋象，佳兴袭游园。\n冰鉴清相照，瑶枝俯可扪。\n剡舟那遽载，郢唱且重翻。\n啖齧深怜武，栖迟酷爱袁。\n韩诗高孰抗，谢赋久仍存。\n肃肃东方骑，优优北海樽。\n危楼登郡堞，远目瞰江村。\n摛藻踰梁苑，申严过棘门。\n雄辞端獬豸，险句崒昆崙。\n缀韵金声恊，挥毫墨电奔。\n丰年见先兆，沴气已横吞。\n氛霭销中夜，球琳冒短垣。\n清光交素魄，馀润浃枯根。\n嘉瑞由嘉政，舆歌莫厌繁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46325,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈次全长春轩","author":"韦骧","text":"闻道新轩外，长春日日花。\n幽人自薖轴，佳卉对葩华。\n波浪千重险，烟云一望赊。\n徒思故园旧，短句寄君家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46326,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太守孙叔康下车","author":"韦骧","text":"荣过故里拥朱轮，乞得偏城便奉亲。\n道路尚惊持斧使，衣冠犹是避骢人。\n下车恳恳唯宣泽，濒海元元正食贫。\n草木无情还自喜，霜威不见见阳春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46327,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别叔康","author":"韦骧","text":"数年为邑幸焉依，德论源源每霁威。\n瓜代逡巡惊易及，棠阴踯躅忍轻违。\n倦踪方此从尘路，旅梦多应绕绣衣。\n回首海城烟雾杳，愿闻三节召公归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46328,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"复用叔康送篇韵和答","author":"韦骧","text":"岸柳参差影画桥，云横日薄旆旌高。\n赠言有宠荣褒衮，制锦无功愧释刀。\n苒苒征途行渐远，拳拳德表望空劳。\n仰衔顾遇知何似，负戴丘山过巨鳌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46329,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"京口别叔康","author":"韦骧","text":"舳舻幸会舣江干，再别情悰岂易安。\n坐邑三年师恺悌，归程累日奉盘桓。\n金山寺外波涛晓，铁瓮城头草木寒。\n欲上孤舟又南望，何时重戴触邪冠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46330,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"昨日以事不得陪赴和甫学士之召","author":"韦骧","text":"藩侯遣事风霆疾，御史高谈宇宙宽。\n千里几年成远别，一樽相对尽清欢。\n知无红袖翻新曲，想有雕弓敌暮寒。\n尘迹钩牵违燕集，坐追佳兴入毫端。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46331,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蒜山酒","author":"韦骧","text":"蒜山高阁直连云，酒以山名味独醇。\n玉盏横飞光照眼，金罍满泛气回春。\n幕天欲似刘生颂，卧瓮宁为毕卓身。\n须信主人如此酒，酣酣千里醉深仁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46332,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和潘倅通甫游狼山寺三首 其一","author":"韦骧","text":"川原浩荡杳回环，附郭苍然独此山。\n殿阁栖云长苒苒，庵岩度日自閒閒。\n凋零花草三春后，彷佛阎闾十里閒。\n远邑拘挛闻胜览，驰心闇逐旆旌还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46333,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和潘倅通甫游狼山寺三首 其二","author":"韦骧","text":"参天云木覆危冈，下瞰丛林释氏坊。\n图按古今询露井，水分淮浙看风樯。\n清才得景吟还健，浩气登高力更强。\n公暇此游真可乐，纷纷何算少年场。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46334,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和潘倅通甫游狼山寺三首 其三","author":"韦骧","text":"谯门南向是狼山，车马朝行意思宽。\n风散落花红糁糁，日随飞盖翠团团。\n望穷沧海尘寰小，坐逼空岩昼景寒。\n三伏生秋有馀地，无人画与雍州看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46335,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和行海门","author":"韦骧","text":"画船轻过绿杨湾，风掠双旗势自翻。\n笔吏濡毫写新句，厨人鲙玉荐行樽。\n翩翩舞燕随樯影，一一惊鸥破水痕。\n按部从容有佳趣，苍烟落日肯销魂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46336,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和金沙道中晚景","author":"韦骧","text":"海燕飞如织，红花巧胜裁。\n春光随水去，野色向人来。\n苇薄农家露，林疏古寺开。\n扁舟暂跧缩，旷望指层台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46337,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢通甫寄交藤方并气术图","author":"韦骧","text":"仰高诚府日钦钦，翰墨飞光忽见临。\n练气指迷先六字，饵丹传诀胜千金。\n仁人锡类多推己，尘迹知非早有心。\n聊抒小诗酬厚赐，自惭布鼓若为音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46338,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和叔康首夏书怀五首 其一","author":"韦骧","text":"催得春归始自安，杜鹃啼血血应乾。\n晴林日永午阴重，烟海风多晓气寒。\n壮志经时嗟苒苒，苍颜览照愧团团。\n公馀且学田家饮，也胜沙场引椟丸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46339,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和叔康首夏书怀五首 其二","author":"韦骧","text":"清和气候爽衣冠，海邑稀逢柱础乾。\n朝拂玉徽琴韵紧，夜开宝匣剑光寒。\n肺肠似石终难变，利禄如沙岂易团。\n行学但知无所负，奚为逢射与僚丸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46340,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和叔康首夏书怀五首 其三","author":"韦骧","text":"阮屐因山固少完，陶巾缘酒未尝乾。\n庭疏红药三春过，地近沧溟四月寒。\n堂燕语酣如有诉，林蜂衙退自分团。\n太平吏隐真夷旷，安用机心寓腊丸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46341,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和叔康首夏书怀五首 其四","author":"韦骧","text":"区区并海作民官，手里鱼须竹已乾。\n仕路蹉跎诚计拙，世情巘险为心寒。\n但全冲气充丹府，莫问灵苗采紫团。\n夏景渐长民事简，静开黄卷爇香丸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46342,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和叔康首夏书怀五首 其五","author":"韦骧","text":"诗坛老将气桓桓，招集同盟插未乾。\n句险直从天上落，辞清能使座中寒。\n勇挥健笔蛟生角，旋襞华笺凤破团。\n更爱一时皆善和，声声严鼓中隤丸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46343,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和孙世则以诗送别","author":"韦骧","text":"解印踰旬君已知，新诗相寄重相违。\n由来从宦无期定，不得同时受代归。\n揽辔益嗟贤谊远，异乡况是故人稀。\n宜春台外空回首，独整区区倦翼飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46344,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"介亭二十韵呈杭守祖龙图","author":"韦骧","text":"列石何年出，危亭不日成。\n两行分磊落，八顾壮经营。\n表里山川秀，朝晡气象清。\n江湖俱有趣，天地岂无情。\n聚井看棋布，重城视带萦。\n望通鱼鳖远，势压凤凰轻。\n鸟背飞来见，云头过去平。\n屈盘疏一径，浩荡接双盈。\n难秘神仙境，兹逢赏识精。\n元侯挟馀裕，乐俗沸休声。\n物外笼真概，胸中惬雅诚。\n有时陵翠霭，极目耸红旌。\n九万鹏程近，三千客履荣。\n樽罍卑北海，篇咏小宣城。\n岘首空多嗜，蓬莱谩自评。\n古今为绝观，风月快平生。\n览景聪明旷，书铭意思宏。\n优游傲圭衮，端正等权衡。\n恺悌均吾众，中和得所行。\n此心非苟豫，奚愧介之名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46345,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和陈和叔内翰忆梅花因手植数本又命画工作生枝于屏间","author":"韦骧","text":"翰林清兴满江乡，尤忆梅花趁腊芳。\n已写幽屏外桃李，更摅藻思压班扬。\n自期造化加先意，岂待婵娟借末光。\n幸预樽前此佳赏，还祈手植早飘香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46346,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丛山堂","author":"韦骧","text":"经营新自翰林公，势压南谯气象雄。\n四顾高明千里近，一团苍翠万山丛。\n琅邪路入青林转，丰乐泉疏白石空。\n唐相若能前此制，当时应不暇怀嵩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46347,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵答和叔见招茅庵弈棋","author":"韦骧","text":"岂弟移风州事稀，何妨退食自逶迤。\n新阳来复茅庵暖，喜奉高篇促对棋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46348,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和同游溪北竹园","author":"韦骧","text":"追攀却忆谪仙诗，曾向东城倒接䍦。\n此日清游非痛饮，一时幽趣有枯棋。\n鸟声似逐新阳啭，竹色如便晚景迟。\n胜概佳辰莫轻寘，看看召节动归期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46349,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏雪","author":"韦骧","text":"密雪乘新腊，凝阴混太清。\n洒空寒送色，著物静无声。\n舞恨庭除隘，铺宜原野平。\n枯株资点缀，朽壤藉包并。\n价踊村垆酒，愁添古塞兵。\n巧裁梁苑赋，幽动剡溪情。\n可庆丰年兆，何虞盭气生。\n行看穷岁籥，坐喜覆山城。\n远祖篇章在，元侯德政成。\n与民为福外，阊阖一心倾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46350,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏雪霁月夜见简","author":"韦骧","text":"百尺城头雪月间，城楼更向碧霄干。\n优游野步来危坐，彷佛仙踪在广寒。\n幽致独为中夜赏，清辉分与近邻看。\n瑶台十二传佳句，潇洒高情岂易阑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46351,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和雪前数刻迎郊赦口占","author":"韦骧","text":"君恩无远近，千里到山城。\n人意方均喜，天心为降霙。\n旌旗增德色，箫鼓变和声。\n盛际千年会，谁将史册评。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46352,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"明月庵","author":"韦骧","text":"南谯郡古牙城壮，城上楼台屹相向。\n晴天落日碧山横，登览依稀在屏障。\n从容北步上茅庵，圆如毡帐幽如岩。\n眼前竹石皆自得，物外气象容谁探。\n公馀时来兴清切，幅巾道服双筇节。\n廓然遗照坐可忘，更向庵心画明月。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46353,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和閒步城上率游城南","author":"韦骧","text":"城南古木未全凋，溪里寒鱼正可撩。\n红旆追攀真得趣，尘怀万斛等閒消。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46354,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和夜登东阁","author":"韦骧","text":"夜初乘兴上城头，白玉蟾蜍碧玉天。\n爽旷襟怀谁得似，谪仙身世岂非前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46355,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"辞劝饮","author":"韦骧","text":"主意固慇勤，须辞酒味醇。\n愿为投辖客，不作吐茵人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46356,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和会峰亭","author":"韦骧","text":"千峰环聚翠模糊，欲卜为邻岂易图。\n且使缣绡画将去，披观未必后仙都。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46357,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和喜奉御札改元元丰口号","author":"韦骧","text":"改号泥封下碧空，天光远烛郡城中。\n禁林旧德承宣重，预向偏州致岁丰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46358,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又和","author":"韦骧","text":"元丰嘉号改明年，万里江山色愈鲜。\n侍从旧臣承紫诏，拜恩如在御床前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46359,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"幽谷回口占呈和叔内翰","author":"韦骧","text":"五骑行歌五马前，乱云轻点乱峰巅。\n此时佳兴此中醉，一阕清诗一玉船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46360,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和山郡早起 其一","author":"韦骧","text":"牙城晓色动旌旗，笔吏来钞枕上诗。\n溪柳山梅应闇觉，先春芳意肯迟迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46361,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和山郡早起 其二","author":"韦骧","text":"铃斋书几烛花消，帘外寒霜晓尚飘。\n却忆夜乘行乐处，烟村云坞听农谣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46362,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和腊日初晴会同僚射饮投壶","author":"韦骧","text":"晓风吹雨作晴云，腊日山城已似春。\n林木欣欣初有趣，郡斋皦皦迥无尘。\n祭军雅戏齐酣战，矍圃环观密布鳞。\n此乐得为知所自，天将丰岁与滁人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46363,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和雪意","author":"韦骧","text":"冻云惨淡连吴野，舞雪缤纷斗楚宫。\n郡守华堂方置酒，山翁鹤驭忽乘风。\n未看夜月光辉助，已喜寒梅信息通。\n欲把新诗解嗟叹，强随高韵愧无功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46364,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"坐中闻击鼓殴傩声戏联数韵","author":"韦骧","text":"故岁妖疠逐，新春祥庆多。\n旌旗催出猎，箫鼓引欧傩。\n??将军至，鬅鬙罗刹过。\n丹书神按籍，白昼士挥戈。\n革面徒为异，清门岂有魔。\n成功在搜厌，正气满天和。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46365,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"行县坐野馆食次得所贶手墨兼惠雀鲊兔馔因以鄙句驰谢","author":"韦骧","text":"清江雀鲊冠江南，罝兔鲜腴美可参。\n旅食寻常疑指动，铃斋方丈忽分甘。\n行庖饤饾珍非八，下箸矜持嗅必三。\n知味便知公意重，属餍宁以小人贪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46366,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和郡斋即事","author":"韦骧","text":"郡斋铃索静无声，风引香烟入翠屏。\n棋胜文枰子收玉，诗成汗简竹书青。\n治民不害为高卧，对客何尝衒独醒。\n他日凤凰池上乐，也应难忘养生经。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46367,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和岁除","author":"韦骧","text":"莫惜年华此夕凋，漫漫将旦即春朝。\n缇帷指刻更残律，析木循环复建杓。\n玉盏椒花投晓荐，银檠蜡炬隔年消。\n祗应幽谷知时早，已欲飞迁翠木乔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46368,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元丰改元元日登行春阁","author":"韦骧","text":"夜尽铜壶漏，朝生玉律春。\n日称元最重，年与号俱新。\n郡阁晴光早，山城喜气均。\n椒觞初献寿，仙木已书神。\n鹰隼飞还止，龙蛇蛰欲伸。\n溪冰仍泛泛，园柳自欣欣。\n物意幡然作，人情岂不伦。\n区区添甲子，敛拙任洪钧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46369,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和岁节见招城上閒步","author":"韦骧","text":"山头宿霭微微见，木末春风细细生。\n动植逢时俱有意，乾坤造物本无情。\n拘挛未易逃绳检，休暇何妨解组缨。\n所幸得吟潇洒句，又随旌旆上牙城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46370,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和天庆观醮宿","author":"韦骧","text":"璧月团团彻晓明，琳宫深邃寂无声。\n传闻此夜曾斋宿，读著新诗骨也清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46371,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和因观罩鱼斫鲙 其一","author":"韦骧","text":"一丈深溪一丈鱼，不论高价只愁无。\n携来缕作霜盘鲙，美玉纷纷得所沽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46372,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和因观罩鱼斫鲙 其二","author":"韦骧","text":"昔咏洗刀鱼眼红，少陵才思摩秋空。\n今朝大嚼有馀兴，佳句复出文章翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46373,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和野步","author":"韦骧","text":"追随仙舫南溪去，欲向春波掷钓竿。\n无奈东风揽清兴，却吹晴霭作溪寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46374,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和柳眼","author":"韦骧","text":"觇烟窥月早于梅，不待东风著意催。\n应为朱轮屡回顾，未春先向道傍开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46375,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小桧毬","author":"韦骧","text":"裁芳剪嫩巧间关，屈叶蟠枝不可攀。\n抛掷似遗春女戏，一团轻翠在朱栏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46376,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和见招","author":"韦骧","text":"仙馆憩旌舆，清篇手自书。\n拨烦虽欲往，俗吏得休无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46377,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹径","author":"韦骧","text":"萦纡一道贯檀栾，入翠穿斜步履悭。\n俗客也应无暇到，不烦春笋为遮拦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46378,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和宝严阁","author":"韦骧","text":"佛宫高阁踞城东，巾履閒来面碧峰。\n风却云头护清景，春催柳眼作先容。\n溪傍几簇红梢露，竹外谁家翠幕重。\n玉局棋收归路近，昏鸦惊溃一声钟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46379,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和立春日东风雪意偶作","author":"韦骧","text":"紞紞城头五鼓催，东风连夜逐春回。\n物心方喜寒威改，云色犹将雪意来。\n戟户劝农牛破土，琴堂介寿蚁浮醅。\n何妨盈尺饶嘉瑞，发滞开萌有迅雷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46380,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和山城灯夜","author":"韦骧","text":"山城灯夕兴厌厌，俗乐年丰令节参。\n竿首挂星还拱北，云中回雁倦图南。\n笙箫度曲喧芳席，綵翠交光结秀岩。\n邦伯欲归人恋恋，帐兵休报鼓声三。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46381,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上元后南溪泛舟联句","author":"韦骧","text":"野渡半篙水，春风一苇航。\n柳梢舒嫩绿，梅萼泛幽香。\n绣羽惊波起，翠鳞跳日光。\n环城得佳趣，清思满高塘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46382,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和适意","author":"韦骧","text":"阳春催物态，清暇养天和。\n求外于情薄，陶真所得多。\n梅苞新烂漫，松影旧婆娑。\n此日衔杯乐，何如鼓腹歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46383,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和春阴倦游","author":"韦骧","text":"铃阁兴何幽，公庭讼不留。\n未能清昼寝，偶作夹城游。\n竹色仍烟翠，梅香趁水流。\n持杯听暮角，一任起楼头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46384,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和新晴","author":"韦骧","text":"泛鹢兼乘竹，高低秀色间。\n鸭头生野水，凤翼展晴山。\n掎摭青春态，消磨白日閒。\n郡园双白鹭，投晚逐人还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46385,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]